<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Canon Sales Co Inc,</p>
<p>Five billion yen unsecured due 2002.</p>
<p>Five billion yen unsecured due 2003.</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
<p>10 billion yen unsecured due 2007.  </p>
<p>-BBB-</p>
<p>Hikari Tsushin Inc, 0.49 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001.</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Nippon Ceramic Co Ltd, 0.48 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Takahashi Curtain Wall Corp, 0.09 billion yen unsecured with warrants due 2001.  </p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Hunet Inc, 0.45 billion Euroyen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
</text>
